### ==========================================
### LABORATORY WORK 7 & 8: HTTP CLIENT REQUESTS
### ==========================================

### 1. List all books with pagination and default sort (Lab 8 Task 4.1)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books?page=0&size=3
Accept: application/json

### 2. List books with pagination and sorting by year descending (Lab 8 Task 4.2)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books?page=1&size=3&sort=year,desc
Accept: application/json

### 3. List books filtered by author
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books?author=Bloch
Accept: application/json

### 4. List books filtered by genre (Lab 8)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books?genre=TECHNOLOGY&page=0&size=5
Accept: application/json

### 5. Sort by non-existent field (Lab 8 Task 4.2 error test)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books?sort=nosuchfield
Accept: application/json

### 6. Get book by id (200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/1
Accept: application/json

### 7. Get book by id - missing book (404 Not Found ProblemDetail)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/999
Accept: application/problem+json

### 8. Create a valid book (201 Created + Location header)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Design Patterns",
  "author": "Erich Gamma",
  "year": 1994,
  "genre": "TECHNOLOGY"
}

### 9. Create book with invalid body (blank title - 400 Bad Request ProblemDetail)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "author": "Erich Gamma",
  "year": 1994,
  "genre": "TECHNOLOGY"
}

### 10. Create book with duplicate title (409 Conflict ProblemDetail)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Effective Java",
  "author": "Joshua Bloch",
  "year": 2018,
  "genre": "TECHNOLOGY"
}

### 11. Update existing book (200 OK)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Effective Java 3rd Edition",
  "author": "Joshua Bloch",
  "year": 2018,
  "genre": "TECHNOLOGY"
}

### 12. Delete book (204 No Content)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/books/1

### 13. Delete same book again (404 Not Found ProblemDetail)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/books/1

### 14. Derived Query: Top 3 books in genre ordered by year desc (Lab 8 Task 3.1)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/top3?genre=TECHNOLOGY
Accept: application/json

### 15. Search by title (Lab 8 Task 3.1)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/search?title=action
Accept: application/json

### 16. Variant 1: Query books by publisher name (Lab 8 Variant 1)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/publisher?name=Addison-Wesley
Accept: application/json

### 17. Bulk update: Archive books older than year (Lab 8 Task 3.2)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books/archive?year=2010

### 18. OpenAPI documentation JSON
GET http://localhost:8080/v3/api-docs
Accept: application/json

### 19. Swagger UI interface
GET http://localhost:8080/swagger-ui.html
